msgid "LCD Shield"
msgstr "LCD Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/lcd-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The LCD Shield is a 1.8 inch 128x160 SPI TFT for showing live frames or "
"debugging information directly from the OpenMV Cam. Ideal for field robotics"
" and stand-alone deployments."
msgstr ""
"De LCD Shield is een 1,8 inch 128x160 SPI TFT voor het tonen van live frames"
" of debuginformatie rechtstreeks vanaf de OpenMV Cam. Ideaal voor "
"veldrobotica en zelfstandige implementaties."

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/lcd-shield.rst:11
msgid ""
"For full datasheet, photos, and ordering see the `LCD Shield product page "
"<https://openmv.io/products/lcd-shield>`_."
msgstr ""
"Voor de volledige datasheet, foto's en bestelinformatie, zie de "
"`productpagina van de LCD Shield <https://openmv.io/products/lcd-shield>`_\\"
" ."

